EXHIBIT "A"

Watermark I Property Legal Description (Montgomery County)

FIELD NOTES DESCRIPTION OF 10.780 ACRES OF LAND, OUT OF THE JOHN CORNER SURVEY, A-8, MONTGOMERY COUNTY, TEXAS, AND BEING ALL OF THAT CERTAIN CALLED 10.780 ACRE TRACT CONVEYED TO WALDEN ROAD GROUP TRUST AND DESCRIBED BY DEED RECORDED UNDER MONTGOMERY COUNTY CLERK'S FILE NO. 2003-068281 OF THE DEED RECORDS OF MONTGOMERY COUNTY, TEXAS, SAID 10.780 ACRE TRACT OF LAND BEING MORE PARTICULARLY DESCRIBED BY METES AND BOUNDS AS FOLLOWS: [BEARINGS REFERENCED TO THE NORTH LINE OF PALM BEACH ESTATES, AS RECORDED IN CABINET K, SHEETS 184 & 185, MONTGOMERY COUNTY MAP RECORDS, SAID NORTH LINE BEARING S 87 22'19" N]:

BEGINNING at a 5/8 inch iron rod set for the Northwesterly corner of Restricted Reserve "B", Palm Beach Estates Subd., as recorded in Cab. K, Shts. 184 & 185 of the Montgomery County Map Records, said iron rod also marks the Southwesterly corner of said called 10.780 acre tract, and the herein described tract, said iron rod falling in the Easterly right-of-way line of Walden Road (100 feet wide);

THENCE, North 12 degrees 10 minutes 32 seconds West, along the Easterly right-of-way line of Walden Road, a distance of 308.69 feet to a 5/8 inch iron rod found for the Point of Curvature of a curve to the Right;

THENCE, Northerly, continuing along the Easterly right-of-way line of Walden Road, with said curve to the Right, having a central angle 38 degrees 00 minutes 52 seconds, a radius of 750.00 feet, an arc length of 497.61 feet and a chord bearing and distance of North 06 degrees 51 minutes 37 seconds East, 488.53 feet to a 5/8 inch iron rod set for the Point of Tangency;

THENCE, North 25 degrees 51 minutes 14 seconds East, continuing along the Easterly right-of-way line of Walden Road, a distance of 238.97 feet to a point for the Westerly corner of Lake Crest Estates Subd., as recorded in Cab. J, Shts. 116 & 117 of the Montgomery County Map Records and the Northwesterly corner of the herein described tract;

THENCE, South 40 degrees 35 minutes 00 seconds East, along the Southwesterly line of said Lake Crest Estates, a distance of 174.09 feet to a 5/8 inch iron rod set for an angle point along the Shoreline of Lake Conroe;

THENCE, South 55 degrees 05 minutes 40 seconds East, along the North line of said called 10.780 acre tract, a distance of 492.70 feet to a 5/8 inch iron rod set for an angle point;

THENCE, South 69 degrees 55 minutes 40 seconds East, along the North line of said called 10.780 acre tract, a distance of 69.19 feet to a 5/8 inch iron rod found for the Northeasterly corner of said 10.780 acre tract and the herein described tract, said iron rod also marks the Northerly corner of Lot 1 of said Palm Beach Estates;

THENCE, South 30 degrees 37 minutes 11 seconds West, along the common line between said Lot 1 and said 10.780 acre tract, a distance of 636.48 feet to a 5/8 inch iron rod found for the Northeasterly corner of said Restricted Reserve "B" and the Southeasterly corner of the herein described tract;

THENCE, South 87 degrees 22 minutes 19 seconds West, along the North line of said Reserve "B", a distance of 356.12 feet to the POINT OF BEGINNING and containing 10.780 acres of land, more or less.

A 3.6533 acre portion of the said 10.780 acres having been platted as WATERMARK SECTION ONE, PHASE ONE UNIT DEVELOPMENT, according to the map or plat thereof recorded in Cabinet Z, Sheet 1202 of the Map Records of Montgomery County, Texas.
